{"id":"8eb27a8b07c2dc2b","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-finite-rank-successors.md","title":"All Lower Ranks Occur among Successors","display":"lem-finite-rank-successors — All Lower Ranks Occur among Successors","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-finite-rank-successors","aliases":["89-lem-finite-rank-successors"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-finite-rank-successors — All Lower Ranks Occur among Successors","depends_on":["[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-finite-rank-successors"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-finite-rank-successors</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-finite-rank-successors — All Lower Ranks Occur among Successors"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"437e16026e9e0691\" href=\"?note=437e16026e9e0691\" title=\"89-df-finite-frame-rank\">89-df-finite-frame-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_F\">\\(\\rho_F\\)</span> 为有限路径秩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite\\text{-}rank\\text{-}successors}\\vdash\n\\{\\rho_F(v)\\mid v\\in W,\\ wRv\\}=\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid i&lt;\\rho_F(w)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite\\text{-}rank\\text{-}successors}\\vdash\n\\{\\rho_F(v)\\mid v\\in W,\\ wRv\\}=\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid i&lt;\\rho_F(w)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 94–95；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 加在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 出发的最长路径前，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_F(w)\\ge\\rho_F(v)+1\">\\(\\rho_F(w)\\ge\\rho_F(v)+1\\)</span>。反向取从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 出发的最长路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=w_nRw_{n-1}R\\cdots Rw_0\">\\(w=w_nRw_{n-1}R\\cdots Rw_0\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\rho_F(w)\">\\(n=\\rho_F(w)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，传递性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRw_i\">\\(wRw_i\\)</span>；该后缀说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_F(w_i)\\ge i\">\\(\\rho_F(w_i)\\ge i\\)</span>。若它大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>，把更长路径与从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_i\">\\(w_i\\)</span> 的前缀拼接，会超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_F(w_i)=i\">\\(\\rho_F(w_i)=i\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时两侧均空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-finite-frame-rank","status":"resolved","id":"437e16026e9e0691","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite\\text{-}rank\\text{-}successors}\\vdash\n\\{\\rho_F(v)\\mid v\\in W,\\ wRv\\}=\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid i<\\rho_F(w)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"wRv","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_F(w)\\ge\\rho_F(v)+1","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"w=w_nRw_{n-1}R\\cdots Rw_0","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\rho_F(w)","display":false},{"tex":"i<n","display":false},{"tex":"wRw_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_F(w_i)\\ge i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"w_i","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_F(w_i)=i","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":1151,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e21aff80559d65a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a04766d8c28cddc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["437e16026e9e0691"]}